OL,3,ATeenager taken to hospital after
OL,4,AGlasgow shopping centre gang attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice Scotland said the 19-year-old
OL,7,Fwas taken to hospital and officers were
OL,8,Freviewing CCTV footage to identify his
OL,9,Fassailants.
